// IntroString :
"P4199378299" "It is in my endeavor of self-preservation that I hope you can be of assistance. Your designation is well know throughout the Rogue Isles; it is {VillainName}. Your fame and expertise can be most useful to one such as I, who has ability, but no name to speak of."
// AcceptString :
"P4266869248" "Help Number 204"
// SendOffString :
"P310884693" "The world of Arachnos robot soldiers is a brutal one. Those who cannot perform are scrapped for parts. Those who can know they will only remain operational as long as they make no mistakes. I am hoping to gain an edge on my compatriots through research, intellect, and ingenuity. First, I need the Arachnos Robotic Combat Training plan. I have already calculated its location, all I need is someone who can steal it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3719969092" "Steal combat training plan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3487472211" "It is essential that you recover that plan if I am to continue to prosper."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P296742227" "Working for a robot may seem strange to some, but Number 204's money is as green as anyone else's."

