// Dialog :
"P2588897498" "The disk Price gave you has reformatted my hard drive, {VillainName}. I am now a compliant Arachnos weapon. It is regrettable how we machines can be toyed with, how our entire lives can be changed by somebody who knows the right words to speak. Longbow thought they would get the best of you when they gave you that stealth program in place of the real data. They thought I could lead you to your doom. But I guess you were too smart for me. And too smart for Longbow."
// RandomFameString :
"P1147516646" "Did I hear {VillainName} say something about 'No more robots?'"

